            "review_title": "Review at Senta Vegetarian",
            "review_text": "Dumbinchen\nLandshut, Germany505 contributions\n0\nPerfect for vegetarians in Nha Trang\nSep 2022 • Couples\nWe really liked this restaurant. We were hungry so we had spring rolls and Tora as appetizers. Tora is a vegetable comparable to potato. This dish was really intensive and the best one. As main courses we chose green and red curry served in coconut. Both tasted very different and good. Together with two beverages we payed 17€ for 4 dishes, what is not the cheapest but reasonable. We would go again.\nRead more\nWritten September 5, 2022\nKien Tran\nDear Dumbinchen, thank you very much for visiting us and give us your feedback. It's great to know that you really liked our restaurant and enjoyed the food. We hope to welcome you again very soon. Have a good day!\nRead more\nWritten September 8, 2022\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
